WEBVTT

1
00:01:59.995 --> 00:02:01.330
I must see the queen.

2
00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:08.211
Your Grace.

3
00:02:22.351 --> 00:02:23.828
He is risen.

4
00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:26.289
- Who?
- Aegon!

5
00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:27.648
Sunfyre is alive.

6
00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:29.941
Out!

7
00:02:32.778 --> 00:02:35.238
Sunfyre is dead. rotting in a wasteland.

8
00:02:37.908 --> 00:02:39.117
Sit down.

9
00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:43.806
Aegon burned the Mooton host
at Rook's Rest.

10
00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.374
and then flew...

11
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:48.335
I don't know where.

12
00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:53.256
His supporters have already sent
ravens throughout the realm...

13
00:02:54.466 --> 00:02:56.301
announcing the king's return.

14
00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:58.988
The smallfolk name it a sign from the gods

15
00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.074
that Aegon is ordained to rule.
that he and his dragon

16
00:03:01.098 --> 00:03:03.767
have been resurrected
to reclaim the throne.

17
00:03:04.351 --> 00:03:08.498
At this moment. mine own subjects
gather outside the Grand Sept.

18
00:03:08.522 --> 00:03:10.708
beseeching the gods
to say who is meant to rule them.

19
00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:13.378
After all for which
I have fought and suffered!

20
00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:14.403
Rhaenyra.

21
00:03:26.415 --> 00:03:29.018
The lesser gods have no say
in what is to come.

22
00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.877
We are the blood of Old Valyria.

23
00:03:33.088 --> 00:03:35.549
You have an absolute power
within your grasp.

24
00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:38.176
You have only to wield it.

25
00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:42.180
Fucking Viserys!

26
00:03:44.516 --> 00:03:45.976
He put me here.

27
00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:49.080
His prophecy has tested me
again and again.

28
00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:51.356
and I have met its every challenge!

29
00:05:54.604 --> 00:05:57.023
Your Grace. have plans been laid
for the Sea Snake's rescue?

30
00:05:59.276 --> 00:06:00.861
There will be a rescue?

31
00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:04.966
Your father will search Tumbleton

32
00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.634
for the Sea Snake once the town
has been reclaimed.

33
00:06:06.658 --> 00:06:10.245
He'll be long dead by then.
Send me now.

34
00:06:11.121 --> 00:06:13.432
You and Addam are needed here
to guard the city.

35
00:06:13.456 --> 00:06:17.711
if indeed these rumors are true
and Sunfyre was allowed to live.

36
00:06:18.879 --> 00:06:21.649
Corlys is your Hand. your oldest ally.

37
00:06:21.673 --> 00:06:24.944
I do not wish your grandsire ill.
but he made his choice.

38
00:06:24.968 --> 00:06:26.761
and we must now pay its price.

39
00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:30.432
It was your fault.

40
00:06:32.642 --> 00:06:33.870
What?

41
00:06:33.894 --> 00:06:36.080
That Lord Corlys
was out there to be taken.

42
00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:37.814
You do not dare.

43
00:06:38.732 --> 00:06:40.942
It is how you've always
treated those who serve you.

44
00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:44.922
Addam and I have labored without rest

45
00:06:44.946 --> 00:06:47.425
over countless sorties
in search of your enemies.

46
00:06:47.449 --> 00:06:49.302
only to be repaid in your anger.

47
00:06:49.326 --> 00:06:53.389
Yes. that is because your sorties
have yielded nothing.

48
00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:56.309
while my enemies have been allowed
to muster their strength.

49
00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:59.002
If a person is useful to you.
you wield them.

50
00:07:00.253 --> 00:07:01.671
But if not. you abandon them

51
00:07:02.631 --> 00:07:04.025
as you have with Rhaena.

52
00:07:04.049 --> 00:07:07.028
And now. she is broken. like my grandsire.

53
00:07:07.052 --> 00:07:09.804
I would have been justified in
abandoning you after the Gullet.

54
00:07:11.181 --> 00:07:12.182
Perhaps.

55
00:07:13.224 --> 00:07:14.392
But you need my dragon.

56
00:07:18.229 --> 00:07:19.648
Insolent child.

57
00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:24.694
I should not blame you for it truly.
Insolence runs in your blood.

58
00:07:25.987 --> 00:07:28.073
As your sister has lately reminded us.

59
00:07:40.585 --> 00:07:41.795
Good morrow. my lords.

60
00:07:42.629 --> 00:07:43.880
"Good morrow." indeed.

61
00:07:45.382 --> 00:07:47.318
We've just sailed through
the night from Driftmark.

62
00:07:47.342 --> 00:07:50.595
after learning our Lord Admiral
is hostage to the Hightowers.

63
00:07:51.638 --> 00:07:54.975
The queen has called upon you
to secure King's Landing.

64
00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:59.455
To answer her could mean our lord's death.

65
00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:02.273
Lord Corlys knew of the risks
of his adventures.

66
00:08:03.775 --> 00:08:06.337
He would want us to appraise
Velaryon honor

67
00:08:06.361 --> 00:08:07.654
as greater than his life.

68
00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:11.491
Who are you to speak
to our lord's desires?

69
00:08:13.118 --> 00:08:14.661
His eldest living son.

70
00:08:17.414 --> 00:08:18.790
And named successor.

71
00:08:20.834 --> 00:08:24.337
Your once and future Lord of the Tides.

72
00:08:29.634 --> 00:08:31.344
Open the gates!

73
00:08:46.401 --> 00:08:47.527
About face!

74
00:08:48.737 --> 00:08:50.155
Forward march!

75
00:09:00.248 --> 00:09:01.248
That...

76
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.128
all of it. is for you.

77
00:09:08.089 --> 00:09:09.466
Remarkable. is it not?

78
00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:14.345
But...

79
00:09:15.597 --> 00:09:17.390
you must be made a knight...

80
00:09:18.641 --> 00:09:20.226
before you can be crowned king.

81
00:09:21.728 --> 00:09:22.729
Kneel.

82
00:09:34.908 --> 00:09:36.761
Daeron Targaryen.

83
00:09:36.785 --> 00:09:40.056
do you swear before the eyes
of gods and men

84
00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.309
to defend those
who cannot defend themselves...

85
00:09:43.333 --> 00:09:45.210
Everyone inside!

86
00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:49.398
<i>To protect all women and children...</i>

87
00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:51.424
Come back here! Back!

88
00:09:52.342 --> 00:09:55.446
<i>To obey your captains. your liege lord...</i>

89
00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.073
Seal the gates!

90
00:09:57.097 --> 00:09:59.224
<i>To fight bravely whenever needed...</i>

91
00:10:00.809 --> 00:10:02.787
<i>and to do such other tasks</i>

92
00:10:02.811 --> 00:10:04.497
<i>- as are laid upon you...</i>
- Steady!

93
00:10:04.521 --> 00:10:06.040
<i>- However hard...</i>
- Hoist!

94
00:10:06.064 --> 00:10:08.751
<i>Or humble or dangerous they may be?</i>

95
00:10:08.775 --> 00:10:09.775
Halt!

96
00:10:14.155 --> 00:10:15.240
I swear it.

97
00:10:22.831 --> 00:10:24.582
Then. rise a knight.

98
00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.257
Ser Daeron the Daring.

99
00:10:35.176 --> 00:10:37.011
And light the way.

100
00:10:48.982 --> 00:10:52.318
The Queen of Bastards' armies
are at the gates.

101
00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:55.965
And leading them to the slaughter

102
00:10:55.989 --> 00:10:58.425
will be her uncle. No.

103
00:10:58.449 --> 00:11:00.344
Her lover.

104
00:11:00.368 --> 00:11:02.579
No. Her husband.

105
00:11:04.414 --> 00:11:07.208
Daemon fucking Targaryen.

106
00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:11.129
- And his dragon.
- Of course he's got a fucking dragon!

107
00:11:13.756 --> 00:11:15.216
But he's not gonna use it.

108
00:11:17.468 --> 00:11:19.029
And how do you know?

109
00:11:19.053 --> 00:11:23.099
'Cause his lady wife.
the queen. won't let him.

110
00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:27.520
Rhaenyra's got Daemon on a short lead.

111
00:11:28.646 --> 00:11:31.024
Like a bitch in a kennel.

112
00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:36.070
Another ale for the dragon lord.

113
00:11:38.239 --> 00:11:42.136
The Rogue Prince will soon quake

114
00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:46.557
before the mighty and terrible.

115
00:11:46.581 --> 00:11:48.666
Lord Ulf the White!

116
00:11:56.257 --> 00:11:57.592
Your Grace.

117
00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.238
Your Grace. is aught amiss?

118
00:12:01.262 --> 00:12:02.472
What is it?

119
00:12:03.806 --> 00:12:05.725
The Princess Helaena.

120
00:12:06.684 --> 00:12:08.436
She still has not taken food.

121
00:12:09.687 --> 00:12:14.525
The maesters worry for her health.
especially for the babe in her belly.

122
00:12:20.448 --> 00:12:21.866
Summon Ser Alyn.

123
00:12:24.911 --> 00:12:26.955
I require a full escort to the Grand Sept.

124
00:12:27.705 --> 00:12:31.352
There. today. the High Septon
will anoint me

125
00:12:31.376 --> 00:12:33.920
and bless my reign for all
of King's Landing to see.

126
00:12:35.046 --> 00:12:37.507
There will be no doubt who
the gods have chosen to rule.

127
00:12:39.008 --> 00:12:40.510
At once. Your Grace.

128
00:12:42.095 --> 00:12:43.346
Will that be all?

129
00:12:50.019 --> 00:12:51.019
No.

130
00:12:58.736 --> 00:12:59.737
What is this?

131
00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:01.799
Sers.

132
00:13:01.823 --> 00:13:04.009
- Sers!
- My lady.

133
00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:06.637
Beg pardon for the intrusion.
We weren't given much time.

134
00:13:06.661 --> 00:13:08.222
Time for what?

135
00:13:08.246 --> 00:13:10.891
Your passage has been arranged
aboard the <i>Mermaid's Kiss.</i>

136
00:13:10.915 --> 00:13:13.626
You are to sail for Pentos at dusk.

137
00:13:14.252 --> 00:13:18.339
I am to inform you
that your services here are at an end.

138
00:13:19.966 --> 00:13:22.820
You have served the queen
and the realm most faithfully.

139
00:13:22.844 --> 00:13:25.346
and Her Grace wishes
to extend her gratitude.

140
00:13:27.181 --> 00:13:29.660
You will be provided with gold
sufficient for a manse

141
00:13:29.684 --> 00:13:31.227
and servants of your own.

142
00:13:34.439 --> 00:13:35.648
Be quick about it.

143
00:13:39.235 --> 00:13:41.821
I do not understand either. my lady.

144
00:13:53.374 --> 00:13:55.335
The hour has passed. my lady.

145
00:13:57.462 --> 00:13:59.297
I must return you to your quarters.

146
00:14:22.445 --> 00:14:24.113
This way. princess.

147
00:14:40.588 --> 00:14:42.483
Do not trust the queen.

148
00:14:42.507 --> 00:14:44.818
Aegon has returned. His dragon lives.

149
00:14:44.842 --> 00:14:47.154
Your unborn child is a hostage.

150
00:14:47.178 --> 00:14:49.615
a prize by which she can hold power

151
00:14:49.639 --> 00:14:51.200
- over her enemies.
- Keep moving.

152
00:14:51.224 --> 00:14:53.434
- Enough.
- She will never release you.

153
00:15:04.445 --> 00:15:06.114
<i>Do you remember?</i>

154
00:15:07.407 --> 00:15:09.242
<i>Do you remember?</i>

155
00:15:12.078 --> 00:15:13.329
<i>Help me.</i>

156
00:15:16.499 --> 00:15:17.625
Fret not.

157
00:15:18.251 --> 00:15:19.544
You're alive.

158
00:15:22.004 --> 00:15:23.107
Here.

159
00:15:23.131 --> 00:15:24.382
Drink this.

160
00:15:26.134 --> 00:15:27.374
There'll be another in an hour.

161
00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.031
She poisoned me.

162
00:15:31.055 --> 00:15:34.451
You have realized
you're alone in this world.

163
00:15:34.475 --> 00:15:36.018
In that. we are together.

164
00:15:44.986 --> 00:15:47.071
But I no longer wish to suffer it.

165
00:15:49.574 --> 00:15:51.009
Do you?

166
00:15:51.033 --> 00:15:52.869
Why do you care whether I'm alone?

167
00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.372
Whether I live or die?

168
00:15:59.584 --> 00:16:02.003
I'm a kinslayer. Alys.

169
00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.425
My own brother is dead by my hand.

170
00:16:08.301 --> 00:16:11.512
I have been damned for my trespasses
and cursed to suffer.

171
00:16:14.182 --> 00:16:16.267
You should abandon me.

172
00:16:17.894 --> 00:16:20.188
Lest you bring mine own fate
upon yourself.

173
00:16:26.736 --> 00:16:29.506
When the dragon Balerion
burned this place.

174
00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.824
it was to end Lord Harren's line.

175
00:16:33.326 --> 00:16:35.786
But his line was not so easily ended.

176
00:16:37.246 --> 00:16:38.456
A child. a...

177
00:16:39.832 --> 00:16:40.833
a boy...

178
00:16:42.627 --> 00:16:43.711
lived on.

179
00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:47.715
Burned terribly. but alive.

180
00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.261
His mother would have
given anything to save him.

181
00:16:56.140 --> 00:17:00.037
She summoned maesters
from across the Seven Kingdoms.

182
00:17:00.061 --> 00:17:01.395
but to no avail.

183
00:17:08.486 --> 00:17:10.696
So. she turned to older cures.

184
00:17:12.073 --> 00:17:15.719
She uncovered incantations
more ancient than the land.

185
00:17:15.743 --> 00:17:19.330
She treated with things
that lived in the forest.

186
00:17:22.542 --> 00:17:25.795
But none of it could unmake
what dragon fire made.

187
00:17:27.755 --> 00:17:29.215
And when the boy was gone...

188
00:17:36.347 --> 00:17:38.683
she tried to go with him.

189
00:17:49.527 --> 00:17:52.029
And that is when she learned the cost.

190
00:17:58.286 --> 00:18:00.496
She discovered then she was cursed.

191
00:18:01.163 --> 00:18:02.456
To live on...

192
00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:08.379
to remain within the bounds
of the river kings of old...

193
00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.900
cursed for sharing in Harren's avarice.

194
00:18:11.924 --> 00:18:14.820
Stripped of her name. her title.

195
00:18:14.844 --> 00:18:16.304
her castle.

196
00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:22.828
And sentenced to serve every ha'penny lord
who came here to rule it.

197
00:18:22.852 --> 00:18:25.414
That was a hundred years past.

198
00:18:25.438 --> 00:18:27.481
It's a long time to be alone.

199
00:18:56.218 --> 00:18:57.970
You must eat. sister.

200
00:19:04.602 --> 00:19:05.978
Think of the babe.

201
00:19:06.896 --> 00:19:08.564
You are thinking of him now. too?

202
00:19:10.358 --> 00:19:11.692
You're saying it's a boy?

203
00:19:12.693 --> 00:19:13.693
Do you know this?

204
00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.198
Look at me.

205
00:19:26.999 --> 00:19:28.668
You cannot think I would harm you.

206
00:19:29.585 --> 00:19:32.963
Do you think life is nothing
more than not being dead?

207
00:19:36.717 --> 00:19:39.095
Our father would hate you for this.

208
00:19:42.223 --> 00:19:44.308
And yet he did nothing to prevent it.

209
00:19:45.685 --> 00:19:49.122
I strove to honor his philosophy

210
00:19:49.146 --> 00:19:51.792
until I saw that it would be
the realm's undoing.

211
00:19:51.816 --> 00:19:56.254
There is a beetle that emerges
on the cusp of summer.

212
00:19:56.278 --> 00:19:58.006
It has lots of colors.

213
00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:01.283
Blue. gold. purples.

214
00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.203
It looks like a turtle.

215
00:20:05.955 --> 00:20:07.623
Have you ever noticed it?

216
00:20:08.916 --> 00:20:10.519
I can't say I have.

217
00:20:10.543 --> 00:20:13.271
You can only find it in King's Landing.

218
00:20:13.295 --> 00:20:16.716
It sustains itself on the waste
of other creatures.

219
00:20:21.387 --> 00:20:22.430
It's beautiful.

220
00:20:25.516 --> 00:20:27.852
Well. when summer returns.
you will have to show me.

221
00:20:34.942 --> 00:20:36.819
You don't care about it.

222
00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.614
You're pretending.

223
00:20:42.783 --> 00:20:46.996
All the things you care about are ugly.

224
00:20:48.873 --> 00:20:50.458
This place...

225
00:20:51.709 --> 00:20:52.918
is ugly.

226
00:20:56.714 --> 00:20:58.841
You. yourself...

227
00:21:00.384 --> 00:21:01.486
ugly.

228
00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:02.511
Eat.

229
00:21:03.846 --> 00:21:05.431
Or you will force my hand.

230
00:21:33.918 --> 00:21:34.919
No.

231
00:21:35.836 --> 00:21:37.004
No! No!

232
00:21:37.838 --> 00:21:40.066
No! No! No!

233
00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:41.801
Stop! Stop.

234
00:21:57.358 --> 00:21:58.943
Forward march!

235
00:22:10.663 --> 00:22:11.664
Brother.

236
00:22:13.332 --> 00:22:15.185
Will you march on Tumbleton as well?

237
00:22:15.209 --> 00:22:17.545
No. Today we guard the queen
in her purpose.

238
00:22:18.921 --> 00:22:20.339
Where does she go?

239
00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:28.406
News of Aegon's return has set
the queen on a dark path.

240
00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:31.117
She has grounded Baela
and confined her to the Keep.

241
00:22:31.141 --> 00:22:32.786
Did you know this?

242
00:22:32.810 --> 00:22:34.746
These are dangerous days.

243
00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:37.606
and it is not mine to question Her Grace.

244
00:22:40.484 --> 00:22:41.920
Why would you?

245
00:22:41.944 --> 00:22:45.298
While our father awaits
the Hightower gallows.

246
00:22:45.322 --> 00:22:48.134
Rhaenyra raises you up in his place.

247
00:22:48.158 --> 00:22:50.369
A glorious ascent for a bastard.

248
00:22:53.289 --> 00:22:56.750
I have no ambition
but to discharge my duty.

249
00:22:58.043 --> 00:22:59.169
Be ready!

250
00:23:14.184 --> 00:23:16.478
Form up!

251
00:23:22.443 --> 00:23:23.444
March!

252
00:23:44.089 --> 00:23:45.090
Gods.

253
00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:48.344
How will we face them all?

254
00:23:49.553 --> 00:23:52.348
Bravely and pointlessly.

255
00:23:53.515 --> 00:23:55.017
Take your places. boys.

256
00:23:55.726 --> 00:23:57.811
Keep coming. take your places.

257
00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:00.940
Keep coming. Be brave.

258
00:24:02.691 --> 00:24:04.944
Put the boys to the front.
They must be seen.

259
00:24:06.862 --> 00:24:11.408
My lord. Ulf hasn't reported.
and he's not with his dragon.

260
00:24:16.830 --> 00:24:18.683
Take a tithing of men off each post.

261
00:24:18.707 --> 00:24:19.684
Search the town.

262
00:24:19.708 --> 00:24:20.810
Find him.

263
00:24:20.834 --> 00:24:21.978
You! With me.

264
00:24:22.002 --> 00:24:23.504
- Something's wrong.
- Yes.

265
00:24:24.755 --> 00:24:26.274
We're all going to die.

266
00:24:26.298 --> 00:24:27.466
No.

267
00:24:28.133 --> 00:24:29.468
With Uncle.

268
00:24:30.552 --> 00:24:33.138
He and Roxton have some secret plot afoot.

269
00:24:35.474 --> 00:24:37.118
He has kept it even from me.

270
00:24:37.142 --> 00:24:39.329
- Whatever it was...
- Get away from me!

271
00:24:39.353 --> 00:24:41.855
It has not appeared
to have come to pass.

272
00:24:45.109 --> 00:24:46.461
Please!

273
00:24:46.485 --> 00:24:48.004
Please. ser. we don't want to do it.

274
00:24:48.028 --> 00:24:50.068
- I just want to go home to my mom.
- Don't make us.

275
00:24:50.823 --> 00:24:52.449
I must take wing against the enemy.

276
00:24:53.701 --> 00:24:54.701
No!

277
00:24:55.869 --> 00:24:59.790
All these men. these boys.
are here for me.

278
00:25:01.417 --> 00:25:04.229
- I cannot let them fight alone.
- For what purpose. boy?

279
00:25:04.253 --> 00:25:06.398
To become another body
amongst Ormund's countless dead?

280
00:25:06.422 --> 00:25:08.048
What are my choices?

281
00:25:08.549 --> 00:25:11.135
I either fight. or I flee.

282
00:25:17.349 --> 00:25:18.976
Mayhaps there is another.

283
00:25:21.770 --> 00:25:23.230
Dragon!

284
00:25:40.247 --> 00:25:41.957
Ulf the Dragonrider!

285
00:25:43.167 --> 00:25:45.228
I'm looking for Ulf the Dragonrider.

286
00:25:45.252 --> 00:25:46.628
Ulf!

287
00:25:48.547 --> 00:25:49.715
Ulf!

288
00:25:54.261 --> 00:25:58.074
And now. Lord Ormund's boy king
and his faithful squire.

289
00:25:58.098 --> 00:25:59.617
Shut up.

290
00:25:59.641 --> 00:26:02.704
Driftmark lies in ruin.
your legacy in tatters.

291
00:26:02.728 --> 00:26:06.416
But King Daeron.
in all his generosity and wisdom.

292
00:26:06.440 --> 00:26:10.045
can offer a richer future
than the one Rhaenyra has laid for you.

293
00:26:10.069 --> 00:26:12.112
My honor is all that remains to me.

294
00:26:13.530 --> 00:26:16.760
Do you really think I would hawk it
for Hightower coin?

295
00:26:16.784 --> 00:26:17.951
Very well.

296
00:26:18.577 --> 00:26:20.120
The hard road. then.

297
00:26:37.471 --> 00:26:38.514
Make way!

298
00:26:39.723 --> 00:26:40.974
Clear the way!

299
00:26:42.267 --> 00:26:45.604
- Move back!
- Get back! Get back!

300
00:26:46.355 --> 00:26:48.649
Move! Clear the way!

301
00:26:49.858 --> 00:26:51.068
Get back!

302
00:27:07.251 --> 00:27:08.460
Get back!

303
00:27:14.883 --> 00:27:19.197
You are my heir now. Joffrey.
and the duty I pass to you

304
00:27:19.221 --> 00:27:20.889
is more than simple rule.

305
00:27:24.101 --> 00:27:27.080
There is a story
that your grandsire told me.

306
00:27:27.104 --> 00:27:29.189
It was told to him by the Old King.

307
00:27:30.357 --> 00:27:32.192
And I passed it on...

308
00:27:33.485 --> 00:27:34.778
to your brother...

309
00:27:36.655 --> 00:27:38.448
following mine own ascent.

310
00:27:44.246 --> 00:27:46.391
Tumbleton. my lords!

311
00:27:46.415 --> 00:27:47.708
At long last.

312
00:27:49.793 --> 00:27:52.689
If it weren't for Cole.
we'd have been here a fortnight ago.

313
00:27:52.713 --> 00:27:55.650
So easy to forget about him.
Do tell me how he died.

314
00:27:55.674 --> 00:27:56.758
Badly.

315
00:28:00.095 --> 00:28:03.283
My prince. my lords.
a Hightower knight approaches.

316
00:28:03.307 --> 00:28:05.535
So? Kill him.

317
00:28:05.559 --> 00:28:06.894
With Lord Corlys.

318
00:28:09.188 --> 00:28:10.189
Hyah.

319
00:28:22.993 --> 00:28:24.244
Prince Daemon.

320
00:28:25.037 --> 00:28:26.639
I am Ser Gwayne Hightower.

321
00:28:26.663 --> 00:28:27.831
Well met.

322
00:28:28.373 --> 00:28:29.791
Fuck me.

323
00:28:32.628 --> 00:28:34.838
I've seen more meat on a butcher's knife.

324
00:28:36.840 --> 00:28:38.091
Can I kill him?

325
00:28:38.884 --> 00:28:40.570
You already know Lord Corlys.

326
00:28:40.594 --> 00:28:41.595
Are you well?

327
00:28:42.721 --> 00:28:43.764
I'm well enough.

328
00:28:46.600 --> 00:28:48.244
So. speak.

329
00:28:48.268 --> 00:28:51.331
My cousin Ormund
has taken leave of his senses.

330
00:28:51.355 --> 00:28:53.041
He would rather die than admit defeat.

331
00:28:53.065 --> 00:28:54.066
And you?

332
00:28:55.067 --> 00:28:56.485
Well. I'm not blind.

333
00:28:57.736 --> 00:28:59.863
I know we will not survive the day
if you attack.

334
00:29:01.114 --> 00:29:02.699
So. as a token of good faith...

335
00:29:06.328 --> 00:29:07.496
I return your Hand.

336
00:29:09.581 --> 00:29:11.250
Four fingers of him. at least.

337
00:29:12.125 --> 00:29:13.293
I've come to sue for peace.

338
00:29:14.127 --> 00:29:15.521
To plead with you

339
00:29:15.545 --> 00:29:17.256
at the behest of Daeron Targaryen.

340
00:29:18.298 --> 00:29:21.277
The latest in your line of false kings.

341
00:29:21.301 --> 00:29:22.862
The war will end
when all the traitors' heads

342
00:29:22.886 --> 00:29:24.972
are mounted on spikes
above the King's Gate...

343
00:29:25.973 --> 00:29:27.116
and not before.

344
00:29:27.140 --> 00:29:28.850
Listen to Daeron's entreaty.

345
00:29:29.685 --> 00:29:31.079
Divide the realm.

346
00:29:31.103 --> 00:29:33.665
Let the queen rule over the Crownlands.
the North. the Vale.

347
00:29:33.689 --> 00:29:35.041
all the lands watered by the Trident.

348
00:29:35.065 --> 00:29:38.086
and let Daeron rule from Oldtown.

349
00:29:38.110 --> 00:29:39.820
Please!

350
00:29:40.988 --> 00:29:44.175
Let me kill this milk-suck
southerling cunt.

351
00:29:44.199 --> 00:29:46.261
The realm was once seven kingdoms.

352
00:29:46.285 --> 00:29:47.929
before the Conqueror. when we were divided

353
00:29:47.953 --> 00:29:49.389
- but at peace...
- Stop!

354
00:29:49.413 --> 00:29:51.206
My good Lord Hand.

355
00:29:51.915 --> 00:29:54.960
I thought the Hightowers
might have cut off your tongue as well.

356
00:29:58.005 --> 00:29:59.298
Hightower is not wrong.

357
00:30:00.299 --> 00:30:02.277
There are great houses
who still hold to the precedent

358
00:30:02.301 --> 00:30:06.239
set by the Great Council
that a woman cannot rule.

359
00:30:06.263 --> 00:30:08.616
It was your wife
who was passed over. Corlys.

360
00:30:08.640 --> 00:30:10.743
Rhaenyra seized the throne
with a horde of dragons.

361
00:30:10.767 --> 00:30:12.245
Her rule is now unassailable.

362
00:30:12.269 --> 00:30:14.330
The queen has many dragons. yes.

363
00:30:14.354 --> 00:30:15.897
but the great houses hesitate.

364
00:30:17.107 --> 00:30:19.818
Her subjects do not feel safe.
nor should they.

365
00:30:20.944 --> 00:30:22.821
Aemond and Vhagar remain at large.

366
00:30:29.745 --> 00:30:31.681
Give Prince Daeron Oldtown.

367
00:30:31.705 --> 00:30:34.892
Name him Lord Paramount of the Reach.

368
00:30:34.916 --> 00:30:37.186
Daeron will never be king.

369
00:30:37.210 --> 00:30:39.647
but he and his dragon
can be wardens of the South.

370
00:30:39.671 --> 00:30:41.631
That wasn't what I was offering.

371
00:30:44.384 --> 00:30:46.154
Wed Daeron to Rhaena.

372
00:30:46.178 --> 00:30:48.072
Seal the breach between your houses.

373
00:30:48.096 --> 00:30:50.366
With the combined will of King's Landing.

374
00:30:50.390 --> 00:30:53.369
the Reach. the North.
the Riverlands. and the Vale.

375
00:30:53.393 --> 00:30:56.480
Rhaenyra can quickly bring the West
and the Stormlands to heel.

376
00:30:57.230 --> 00:30:58.916
And what will the usurper Aegon say

377
00:30:58.940 --> 00:31:00.877
when he hears of this pact?

378
00:31:00.901 --> 00:31:04.464
He now scuttles about somewhere
on his crippled dragon.

379
00:31:04.488 --> 00:31:06.966
half-cooked. but still fit to rule.

380
00:31:06.990 --> 00:31:08.575
Or so he thinks.

381
00:31:09.993 --> 00:31:11.244
Was that news?

382
00:31:12.788 --> 00:31:15.767
It is so tragic to see
brother set against brother.

383
00:31:15.791 --> 00:31:18.436
Aegon and Aemond would be common enemies
of this new alliance.

384
00:31:18.460 --> 00:31:19.878
Alliance?

385
00:31:21.129 --> 00:31:25.026
I never took you for a traitor.
Corlys. and worse. a craven.

386
00:31:25.050 --> 00:31:27.761
What price has the boy king
offered for your fealty?

387
00:31:28.929 --> 00:31:29.929
Peace.

388
00:31:31.181 --> 00:31:34.160
Two paths diverge before you. Daemon.

389
00:31:34.184 --> 00:31:36.120
but both lead to the same end.

390
00:31:36.144 --> 00:31:40.333
Rhaenyra sitting the Iron Throne
ruling the Seven Kingdoms.

391
00:31:40.357 --> 00:31:42.067
All that remains for you to decide...

392
00:31:43.485 --> 00:31:46.154
is what you want from this war.

393
00:31:46.696 --> 00:31:47.823
Victory?

394
00:31:48.990 --> 00:31:50.659
Or a mountain of dead Hightowers?

395
00:31:52.160 --> 00:31:54.097
What do you think?

396
00:31:54.121 --> 00:31:56.373
You would callously cast away
the lives of thou...

397
00:31:59.084 --> 00:32:01.479
No one will rule but Rhaenyra.

398
00:32:01.503 --> 00:32:04.107
the ordained Queen of the Andals.
of the First Men.

399
00:32:04.131 --> 00:32:06.359
of beggars and thieves
and cowards like you.

400
00:32:06.383 --> 00:32:10.405
A new Valyria will rise from the ashes
of her usurper half-brothers

401
00:32:10.429 --> 00:32:12.573
and of the Hightowers of Oldtown.

402
00:32:12.597 --> 00:32:15.910
Now. you came to me
under a banner of peace.

403
00:32:15.934 --> 00:32:17.995
so I will give you the choice.

404
00:32:18.019 --> 00:32:21.249
Die here. or behind those walls.

405
00:32:21.273 --> 00:32:23.608
like the rodent you are.

406
00:32:26.069 --> 00:32:27.588
Lord Corlys is my prisoner.

407
00:32:27.612 --> 00:32:29.465
Hightower may return to alert his cousin

408
00:32:29.489 --> 00:32:31.658
- to our imminent coming.
- Get up! Get up!

409
00:32:32.659 --> 00:32:35.555
Bring the ladders and the rams
and form up to march.

410
00:32:35.579 --> 00:32:37.765
The next man to stall on this attack

411
00:32:37.789 --> 00:32:41.460
will be tied to the front
of my fucking horse!

412
00:33:46.358 --> 00:33:47.776
It cannot be.

413
00:33:48.860 --> 00:33:50.111
You are dead.

414
00:33:56.284 --> 00:33:57.577
I'm alive!

415
00:33:59.496 --> 00:34:00.496
Imbecile.

416
00:34:03.458 --> 00:34:05.937
Brother. Brother.

417
00:34:05.961 --> 00:34:07.879
I beg for your forgiveness.

418
00:34:19.474 --> 00:34:20.725
Forgiveness?

419
00:34:24.813 --> 00:34:26.773
I should split you in half.

420
00:34:32.362 --> 00:34:34.698
I should have Sunfyre burn you alive.

421
00:34:35.949 --> 00:34:39.286
But slowly.

422
00:34:40.704 --> 00:34:42.664
So I can see your skin...

423
00:34:43.748 --> 00:34:46.626
peel and blister.

424
00:34:47.419 --> 00:34:48.837
You kinslayer.

425
00:34:50.839 --> 00:34:52.632
You usurper.

426
00:34:54.759 --> 00:34:55.759
You cunt!

427
00:35:04.227 --> 00:35:05.227
No.

428
00:35:07.439 --> 00:35:10.334
No. no. no. no. no. no. no!

429
00:35:10.358 --> 00:35:12.044
I was supposed to enjoy this.

430
00:35:12.068 --> 00:35:13.445
What's wrong with you?

431
00:35:15.697 --> 00:35:16.865
Fight me!

432
00:35:21.786 --> 00:35:24.181
I coveted what you had

433
00:35:24.205 --> 00:35:25.998
and judged you unsuited for the crown.

434
00:35:31.546 --> 00:35:33.131
I tried to kill you to take your place.

435
00:35:35.550 --> 00:35:37.844
You'd be right to sentence me to die.

436
00:35:44.017 --> 00:35:45.101
Fuck you.

437
00:35:46.978 --> 00:35:47.978
Get up.

438
00:35:55.779 --> 00:35:57.173
We're going to Tumbleton.

439
00:35:57.197 --> 00:35:59.949
My prince cannot.
His dragon abandoned him.

440
00:36:01.117 --> 00:36:03.578
- Who's she?
- My betrothed.

441
00:36:12.712 --> 00:36:16.216
Do you know what's happening out there?

442
00:36:19.594 --> 00:36:20.595
No?

443
00:36:22.263 --> 00:36:23.723
Rhaenyra declared me dead.

444
00:36:24.808 --> 00:36:26.410
And after you disappeared.

445
00:36:26.434 --> 00:36:29.562
that little twat Daeron
decided he should be king.

446
00:36:32.857 --> 00:36:34.484
So. here's what we're going to do.

447
00:36:36.444 --> 00:36:38.964
We're going to find Vhagar.

448
00:36:38.988 --> 00:36:40.841
fly to Tumbleton.

449
00:36:40.865 --> 00:36:43.928
and put Daeron
and that shitheel Ormund in line.

450
00:36:43.952 --> 00:36:47.390
And then. we're all going
to march on King's Landing

451
00:36:47.414 --> 00:36:49.040
under my banner.

452
00:36:51.084 --> 00:36:54.921
And maybe. when Rhaenyra's head
is on a spike...

453
00:36:56.005 --> 00:36:57.525
and I'm back on the Iron Throne...

454
00:36:57.549 --> 00:36:58.549
Aemond.

455
00:37:01.386 --> 00:37:03.304
Maybe then...

456
00:37:05.098 --> 00:37:06.433
I'll forgive you...

457
00:37:08.309 --> 00:37:10.854
for trying to fucking kill me.

458
00:37:15.567 --> 00:37:18.129
<i>Aside from the main gate.
there's one other way in.</i>

459
00:37:18.153 --> 00:37:20.965
A disused postern on the northeast side.

460
00:37:20.989 --> 00:37:24.051
They've raised wooden battlements
but the defenses are incomplete.

461
00:37:24.075 --> 00:37:26.011
so there are vulnerable areas.

462
00:37:26.035 --> 00:37:28.305
particularly the walls to the southeast.

463
00:37:28.329 --> 00:37:29.706
Simple enough.

464
00:37:30.832 --> 00:37:32.876
I will burn the battlements
over the main gate.

465
00:37:33.835 --> 00:37:35.396
Once they're clear of resistance.

466
00:37:35.420 --> 00:37:37.690
our van will lead the attack
with Caraxes for cover.

467
00:37:37.714 --> 00:37:40.151
Ulf and Silverwing will guard the rear.

468
00:37:40.175 --> 00:37:41.819
Rhaenyra's banners will fly

469
00:37:41.843 --> 00:37:43.720
above the hold fast by nightfall.

470
00:37:46.014 --> 00:37:48.159
Take every care to preserve
the town and its people.

471
00:37:48.183 --> 00:37:49.183
The realm is watching.

472
00:37:50.602 --> 00:37:52.997
The queen's moral standing
must remain absolute.

473
00:37:53.021 --> 00:37:54.206
Sounds boring.

474
00:37:54.230 --> 00:37:55.583
My prince.

475
00:37:55.607 --> 00:37:58.002
My lords. Movement at the walls.

476
00:37:58.026 --> 00:38:01.529
The enemy has fortified
their numbers with children.

477
00:38:03.490 --> 00:38:04.657
Gods.

478
00:38:05.408 --> 00:38:07.052
- How many?
- Scores.

479
00:38:07.076 --> 00:38:08.471
All along the battlements.

480
00:38:08.495 --> 00:38:10.330
And that's just what I could see.

481
00:38:12.415 --> 00:38:16.228
He's testing you. my prince.
daring you to use your dragon.

482
00:38:16.252 --> 00:38:17.712
The spineless cunt.

483
00:38:19.297 --> 00:38:21.966
Lord Roderick. are you still
prepared to die for our queen?

484
00:38:22.592 --> 00:38:23.903
Can't fucking wait.

485
00:38:23.927 --> 00:38:25.404
Take your greybeards over the walls.

486
00:38:25.428 --> 00:38:27.740
overwhelm them with
your northern fighting spirit

487
00:38:27.764 --> 00:38:29.492
and open the gate from within.

488
00:38:29.516 --> 00:38:32.661
But you are not to die
until you open the gate.

489
00:38:32.685 --> 00:38:34.437
Aye. gate open. then die.

490
00:38:36.147 --> 00:38:37.875
Lord Oscar will lead the flank as planned.

491
00:38:37.899 --> 00:38:39.919
Ser Garibald has the reserve.

492
00:38:39.943 --> 00:38:41.778
The center is mine.

493
00:39:01.381 --> 00:39:03.776
This is the House of the Seven.

494
00:39:03.800 --> 00:39:06.344
No arms are to cross its threshold.

495
00:39:07.345 --> 00:39:10.074
The people of King's Landing gather.

496
00:39:10.098 --> 00:39:12.642
seeking to know
who is ordained to lead them.

497
00:39:14.185 --> 00:39:16.205
You will give them their answer

498
00:39:16.229 --> 00:39:18.207
by anointing me for all to see.

499
00:39:18.231 --> 00:39:21.317
I have already told you
that such is impossible.

500
00:39:22.527 --> 00:39:25.673
And now. after Aegon and his dragon
have been resurrected.

501
00:39:25.697 --> 00:39:28.092
there could be no clearer sign

502
00:39:28.116 --> 00:39:31.911
of whom the gods
have chosen to rule. princess.

503
00:39:32.745 --> 00:39:34.080
I am queen.

504
00:39:36.541 --> 00:39:37.917
The old man forgets.

505
00:39:39.377 --> 00:39:42.297
I wear my father's crown
and sit his throne...

506
00:39:43.298 --> 00:39:45.592
with six dragons at my heel.

507
00:39:46.968 --> 00:39:49.137
You will not deny me
my right a second time.

508
00:39:50.388 --> 00:39:52.867
You may have six dragons.

509
00:39:52.891 --> 00:39:56.537
but I have a Seven-faced god.

510
00:39:56.561 --> 00:40:00.148
I could not possibly oppose their will.

511
00:40:06.321 --> 00:40:08.281
Then. you name yourself a traitor.

512
00:40:11.784 --> 00:40:13.369
I am the High Septon of the Faith.

513
00:40:14.621 --> 00:40:19.059
To harm me is to declare war
upon the Starry Sept.

514
00:40:19.083 --> 00:40:22.712
To damn your soul to the deepest
of the Seven Hells.

515
00:40:26.299 --> 00:40:29.844
You are the blood of Old Valyria.

516
00:40:31.429 --> 00:40:33.181
You answer to higher gods than his.

517
00:40:37.769 --> 00:40:40.438
To them. this house...

518
00:40:41.689 --> 00:40:44.275
is an empty work of brick and stone.

519
00:40:48.655 --> 00:40:51.258
We stand on sacred ground.

520
00:40:51.282 --> 00:40:53.242
A place of refuge!

521
00:41:38.413 --> 00:41:39.872
Before his death...

522
00:41:40.999 --> 00:41:44.502
my father. Viserys the Peaceful...

523
00:41:45.628 --> 00:41:46.879
named me his heir.

524
00:41:49.048 --> 00:41:53.177
Not in secret. but in ceremony.

525
00:41:54.137 --> 00:41:57.992
Hundreds of lords
traveled hundreds of leagues

526
00:41:58.016 --> 00:42:02.145
to swear fealty to me before gods and men.

527
00:42:06.607 --> 00:42:10.028
But my rule was already ordained.

528
00:42:11.154 --> 00:42:13.406
It was prophesied...

529
00:42:14.365 --> 00:42:16.743
long before even Viserys was born.

530
00:42:21.330 --> 00:42:23.499
<i>It began with the Doom...</i>

531
00:42:24.709 --> 00:42:27.146
<i>when fire and hell erupted</i>

532
00:42:27.170 --> 00:42:30.649
to destroy Old Valyria and her people.

533
00:42:30.673 --> 00:42:32.592
I need Ulf the Dragonrider!

534
00:42:34.052 --> 00:42:36.030
In there. Find him!

535
00:42:36.054 --> 00:42:38.282
<i>Only the Targaryens survived.</i>

536
00:42:38.306 --> 00:42:39.616
Where is he?

537
00:42:39.640 --> 00:42:43.186
My family alone were spared.

538
00:42:49.734 --> 00:42:53.255
The gods summoned my ancestor.

539
00:42:53.279 --> 00:42:55.990
<i>Aegon the Conqueror...</i>

540
00:42:56.991 --> 00:43:01.180
<i>to the Seven Kingdoms
to unite a fractured realm</i>

541
00:43:01.204 --> 00:43:05.500
<i>beneath one banner of black and red.</i>

542
00:43:07.335 --> 00:43:09.688
They named him.

543
00:43:09.712 --> 00:43:12.715
Protector of the World of Men.

544
00:43:14.008 --> 00:43:16.552
His duty. to shield it...

545
00:43:17.386 --> 00:43:21.200
from an ancient and sinister darkness

546
00:43:21.224 --> 00:43:23.559
that looms in the far North...

547
00:43:24.435 --> 00:43:28.707
beyond the Wall.
beyond the lands of winter.

548
00:43:28.731 --> 00:43:32.461
And only the might of dragons

549
00:43:32.485 --> 00:43:34.904
can stand against it.

550
00:43:36.823 --> 00:43:41.553
The Conqueror passed this sacred charge

551
00:43:41.577 --> 00:43:46.183
to his chosen descendants.
to the Old King. Jaehaerys.

552
00:43:46.207 --> 00:43:49.436
then to my father. then to me.

553
00:43:49.460 --> 00:43:53.297
The Hightower line
cannot fulfill this prophecy.

554
00:43:55.508 --> 00:43:58.427
If your world is to survive...

555
00:44:00.096 --> 00:44:02.640
I must light the way.

556
00:44:03.558 --> 00:44:07.996
Because I am the Shield of the People.

557
00:44:08.020 --> 00:44:12.108
I am Rhaenyra the Chosen.

558
00:44:27.707 --> 00:44:31.544
Lords. knights. savages. and cutthroats!

559
00:44:35.214 --> 00:44:37.633
Whether you live or die today...

560
00:44:38.634 --> 00:44:41.363
you will be remembered in the histories

561
00:44:41.387 --> 00:44:44.932
as those who began the Hightowers' end!

562
00:44:47.435 --> 00:44:49.687
Grant no mercy!

563
00:44:51.689 --> 00:44:53.149
Give no quarter.

564
00:44:55.484 --> 00:44:58.654
I don't want the best of you.
I want the worst!

565
00:45:10.374 --> 00:45:11.500
Go now...

566
00:45:12.627 --> 00:45:14.503
and kill them.

567
00:45:32.980 --> 00:45:34.857
Right. lads!

568
00:45:36.067 --> 00:45:37.318
Blades out!

569
00:45:38.444 --> 00:45:39.862
Bellies in!

570
00:46:39.255 --> 00:46:41.733
Siege engines. make ready!

571
00:46:41.757 --> 00:46:43.527
Archers. draw.

572
00:46:43.551 --> 00:46:45.237
Draw. draw. draw!

573
00:46:45.261 --> 00:46:46.595
Good aim. lads!

574
00:47:09.869 --> 00:47:11.638
Come on. then!

575
00:47:11.662 --> 00:47:14.725
Send your fucking arrows.

576
00:47:14.749 --> 00:47:16.876
you boy-touching cunts!

577
00:47:34.602 --> 00:47:35.936
Loose!

578
00:48:07.385 --> 00:48:08.386
My lord.

579
00:48:09.387 --> 00:48:12.032
