586
00:48:30.574 --> 00:48:32.719
King Daeron. he sent Ser Gwayne

587
00:48:32.743 --> 00:48:35.055
to treat with the enemy
under a banner of peace.

588
00:48:35.079 --> 00:48:38.350
He freed the Sea Snake.
my lord. as part of the bargain.

589
00:48:38.374 --> 00:48:41.627
Continue the search.
Find Ulf the Dragonrider.

590
00:48:54.890 --> 00:48:56.243
Where is the prince?

591
00:48:56.267 --> 00:48:57.476
The king?

592
