Ser Ulf the White.

599
00:50:56.971 --> 00:50:59.491
What do you mean. you cannot find him?

600
00:50:59.515 --> 00:51:01.809
He has a very large dragon.

601
00:51:02.518 --> 00:51:05.604
Begging pardon. Your Grace.
He is not with his dragon.

602
00:51:16.240 --> 00:51:17.616
Turret!

603
00:51:26.458 --> 00:51:27.644
Stop!

604
00:51:27.668 --> 00:51:29.670
Find that fucking gate. lads!

605
00:51:30.963 --> 00:51:32.047
Take them.

606
00:51:33.132 --> 00:51:34.341
Draw swords!

607
00:51:35.217 --> 00:51:36.844
