625
00:54:25.262 --> 00:54:27.264
That's the gates open then. lads.

626
00:54:29.099 --> 00:54:30.851
And we're still fucking alive.

627
00:54:31.894 --> 00:54:34.038
Find me that boy king.

628
00:54:34.062 --> 00:54:35.062
Go now!

629
00:54:37.274 --> 00:54:39.067
I want Lord Hightower.

630
00:54:57.669 --> 00:54:59.171
Get him out!

631
00:55:02.216 --> 00:55:05.260
