640
00:55:49.179 --> 00:55:50.264
Kat!

641
00:55:54.226 --> 00:55:56.496
Ormund Hightower!

642
00:55:56.520 --> 00:55:57.855
Kinslayer!

643
00:56:04.653 --> 00:56:06.238
Babe killer.

644
00:56:07.865 --> 00:56:09.491
Heathen!

645
00:56:22.212 --> 00:56:24.941
Ser Ulf. I have orders from Prince Daemon

646
00:56:24.965 --> 00:56:27.085
to make certain that you
and your dragon are at the...

647
00:56:38.103 --> 00:56:39.103
