was the only path to glory.

654
00:56:55.954 --> 00:56:57.915
Do not die for Ormund's vanity.

655
00:57:00.584 --> 00:57:02.228
My boy.

656
00:57:02.252 --> 00:57:03.629
My boy. please.

657
00:57:06.256 --> 00:57:07.358
Please!

658
00:57:07.382 --> 00:57:08.383
Stay back.

659
00:57:18.644 --> 00:57:19.645
Stay back.

660
00:57:20.979 --> 00:57:22.606
You'll have to come through me then.

661
00:57:55.430 --> 00:57:57.391
<i>Dracarys!</i>

662
00:58:19.496 --> 00:58:20.998
There you are.

663
00:58:40.934 --> 00:58:42.602
