664
00:58:43.729 --> 00:58:45.355
Perhaps we'll survive the day.

665
00:58:51.987 --> 00:58:52.987
Clear a path!

666
01:00:23.370 --> 01:00:25.807
That's a proper fucking.

667
01:00:25.831 --> 01:00:27.624
By the North.

668
01:00:39.845 --> 01:00:41.781
Fuck you. too.

669
01:00:41.805 --> 01:00:44.015
No. No!

670
01:00:59.531 --> 01:01:01.408
